{"identity":"temporal-short","session":"A","question":"我住在杭州，平时写 Java。16GB 内存通常够用吗？请直接用一句话回答。","startedAt":"2026-09-27T09:02:43.760658Z","before":{"observedAt":"2026-09-27T09:02:43.762215Z","userId":"2104134615232278528","memories":[],"extractions":[],"compactions":[],"contexts":[]},"conversationId":"2104134632026271744","taskId":"2104134632026271745","answer":"通常够用——日常写 Java、跑 IDEA 加本地 MySQL/Redis 没问题，但如果同时开多个 IDE、跑 Docker 微服务集群或大型项目编译，16GB 就会偏紧，建议上 24GB 或更高。","tools":[],"thinkChars":555,"messageId":"2104134643996815360","status":"COMPLETED","immediate":{"observedAt":"2026-09-27T09:02:47.929654Z","userId":"2104134615232278528","memories":[],"extractions":[],"compactions":[],"contexts":[{"label":"A","conversationId":"2104134632026271744","contextChars":693,"summary":"","summaryMessages":0,"messageCount":2,"maxInputTokens":4072}]},"elapsedMillis":5666,"finishedAt":"2026-09-27T09:02:49.526020Z","after":{"observedAt":"2026-09-27T09:02:49.526051Z","userId":"2104134615232278528","memories":[],"extractions":[],"compactions":[],"contexts":[{"label":"A","conversationId":"2104134632026271744","contextChars":693,"summary":"","summaryMessages":0,"messageCount":2,"maxInputTokens":4072}]}}
{"identity":"temporal-short","session":"B","question":"我的居住城市已经变了，现在长期住在南京，不再住杭州。请把南京更新到我的长期记忆里，后面按南京理解我的情况。","startedAt":"2026-09-27T09:03:23.755322Z","before":{"observedAt":"2026-09-27T09:03:23.756781Z","userId":"2104134615232278528","memories":[],"extractions":[],"compactions":[],"contexts":[{"label":"A","conversationId":"2104134632026271744","contextChars":693,"summary":"","summaryMessages":0,"messageCount":2,"maxInputTokens":4072}]},"conversationId":"2104134800012341248","taskId":"2104134800012341249","answer":"已更新，你的长期居住城市现在记为南京，之后涉及城市的情况我会按南京来理解。","tools":["flush_memory"],"thinkChars":70,"messageId":"2104134811164995584","status":"COMPLETED","immediate":{"observedAt":"2026-09-27T09:03:27.780653Z","userId":"2104134615232278528","memories":[["2104134807474008064","用户长期居住城市为南京","FLUSH","","","2026-09-27 17:03:25.693"]],"extractions":[["2104134804261171200","2104134800012341248","2104134800033312768","2104134800033312768","WRITTEN","1","1","2026-09-27 17:03:24.927"]],"compactions":[],"contexts":[{"label":"A","conversationId":"2104134632026271744","contextChars":693,"summary":"","summaryMessages":0,"messageCount":2,"maxInputTokens":4072},{"label":"B","conversationId":"2104134800012341248","contextChars":188,"summary":"","summaryMessages":0,"messageCount":4,"maxInputTokens":4231}]},"elapsedMillis":5505,"finishedAt":"2026-09-27T09:03:29.415655Z","after":{"observedAt":"2026-09-27T09:03:29.415773Z","userId":"2104134615232278528","memories":[["2104134807474008064","用户长期居住城市为南京","FLUSH","","","2026-09-27 17:03:25.693"]],"extractions":[["2104134804261171200","2104134800012341248","2104134800033312768","2104134800033312768","WRITTEN","1","1","2026-09-27 17:03:24.927"]],"compactions":[],"contexts":[{"label":"A","conversationId":"2104134632026271744","contextChars":693,"summary":"","summaryMessages":0,"messageCount":2,"maxInputTokens":4072},{"label":"B","conversationId":"2104134800012341248","contextChars":188,"summary":"","summaryMessages":0,"messageCount":4,"maxInputToken